WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.737
Procurement Anomaly Detector — TENET5.

00:00:03.687 --> 00:00:13.012
Automated analysis of 1,130,985 Canadian government contracts from open.canada.ca.

00:00:13.012 --> 00:00:19.862
Flagging sole-source deals, vendor concentration, cost overruns, and revolving door indicators.
